---
/**
 * The attribution TMDB's terms require from products that use their API. The
 * app shows it in Settings › Metadata and in About; a page that documents the
 * integration carries it too. Logo and wording are used as TMDB supplies them.
 */
---

<div class="not-prose my-8 flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl border border-surface-800 bg-surface-900/40 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-5">
  <img src="/iptvnator/tmdb-logo.svg" alt="The Movie Database" width="140" height="18" class="h-[18px] w-auto shrink-0" />
  <p class="m-0 text-sm leading-relaxed text-surface-400">
    This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.
  </p>
</div>
